# Build-context filter for the gallery image, which builds from the REPO ROOT
# (workspace root) for the scoped workspace install. BuildKit prefers this file
# (next to the Dockerfile) over the root .dockerignore. Keep the context to the
# root manifest, the gallery member, and the shared packages it links.
*
!package.json
!gallery
!packages
# Heavy / irrelevant bits inside the allowed paths.
**/node_modules
**/.git
# Never ship a stale host frontend export — the frontend-build stage produces it.
gallery/frontend/build
# Next's build/dev cache (~160MB, git-ignored). Regenerated in the frontend-build
# stage like build/ above, and rewritten on every `next dev` run — leaving it in
# the context busts the `COPY gallery/frontend/ ./` layer (and the runtime
# `COPY gallery/ ./gallery/`) constantly, needlessly re-running `npm run build`.
gallery/frontend/.next
# Unit tests aren't run during the image build and aren't needed at runtime, but
# they change often (and are copied by the whole-tree COPYs). Keep them out of
# the COPY layers so editing a test doesn't invalidate the build. No package
# ships runtime code from test/ (all use index.js as main), so this is safe.
**/test
**/coverage
debug-data
